{"id": "V2457992923", "set_id": "W3104458125", "title": "Vand", "purl": "vand", "page_type": "page", "content": "<column-set gutter=\"1.8rem\"><column-unit slot=\"0\" span=\"9\"><gallery-slideshow class=\"move-down\" disable-scroll-animation=\"true\" scale=\"100%\" transition-type=\"scrub\"><media-item src=\"/assets/media/O1819649727852199169668260612642-thefinalone-copy-2.jpg\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3225\" limit-by=\"width\" rotation=\"0\" scale=\"100\"></media-item><media-item src=\"/assets/media/Z1852919004980937128364929763874-This-one-again.Redshift_ROP1-copy-2.019.jpg\" width=\"2000\" height=\"2241\" limit-by=\"width\" rotation=\"0\" scale=\"100\"></media-item><media-item src=\"/assets/media/S2798488707013337887104752208418-IMG_0691.jpg\" width=\"3004\" height=\"3240\" limit-by=\"width\" rotation=\"0\" scale=\"100\"></media-item></gallery-slideshow></column-unit><column-unit slot=\"1\" span=\"3\">\n<h2>\n<a class=\"project-title\" href=\"gaze-spacial\" rel=\"history\">Fluid Flows</a><span class=\"icons2\">\n</span>\n  </h2><p class=\"descrip-com\">\nResearch made in Houdini &#x26; Redshift.\n</p><div class=\"icons\"><div id=\"moreText\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<p class=\"project-text\">\nThis research aims to cherish fluid dynamics unpredictability and visually research how fluid dynamics instability can be visualised through 3D renders and simulations. It also shows how much we can learn about nature, people and water by studying them digitally.</p>\n<p class=\"project-text\">Through the use of 3D renders and simulations, I&#x27;ve visualised the unpredictability and complexity of fluid dynamics. </p><div class=\"details\">\n<strong>Year:</strong> 2024<br />\n<strong>Client:</strong> Self-initiated<br />\n</div></div>\n<span class=\"view-full-project\" onclick=\"toggleText(this)\"></span>\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\n    let moreTextElements = document.querySelectorAll(\"#moreText\");\n\n    moreTextElements.